        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur WINFAVCOM, Windsor Rose With Fifth Avenue Knob Combo Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Fifth Avenue ball shape is timeless, its simple design allowing that of the Windsor Rose and matching deadbolt to shine. Intricately detailed, the ornate Windsor Rose With Fifth Avenue Knob Single Cylinder Combo features a fanciful design that is dripping with elegance. The beautiful embellishments of the Windsor Entry Set will surely add glamor to your home. This Grandeur Entry Door Combo Pack includes a high security single cylinder deadbolt meaning it is operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. The Single Cylinder Windsor Entry Set with Fifth Avenue Knob fits doors 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. It is forged from solid brass by Grandeur Decorative Door Hardware and has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 10 year finish warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-windsor-series\"><b>Windsor Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur WINFAVCOM Windsor Rose With Fifth Avenue Knob Single Cylinder Combo:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Windsor Rose With Fifth Avenue Knob Combo Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Windsor Plate Height: 8.66\"</li>\r\n<li>Windsor Plate Width: 2.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Knob Diameter: 2.24\"</li>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Knob Projection: 2.24\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Height: 4.20\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.55\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.66\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/WIN-plate.pdf?v=1704262180\" target=\"new\"><b>Windsor Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FAV-knob.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Fifth Avenue Knob Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/WIN-deadbolt.pdf?v=1704262180\" target=\"new\"><b>Windsor Deadbolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
